{
  "dinner": {
    "version": 1,
    "id": "dinner",
    "title": "周末晚餐计划",
    "inputs": [
      {
        "id": "people",
        "kind": "number",
        "label": "用餐人数",
        "initial": 4,
        "min": 2,
        "max": 8,
        "step": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "main",
        "kind": "choice",
        "label": "选择主菜",
        "initial": "chicken",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "chicken",
            "label": "宫保鸡丁",
            "description": "约 25 分钟 · 微辣酸甜"
          },
          {
            "id": "beef",
            "label": "番茄炖牛腩",
            "description": "约 100 分钟 · 浓郁软烂"
          },
          {
            "id": "tofu",
            "label": "香菇烧豆腐",
            "description": "约 20 分钟 · 鲜香清淡"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "resources": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "intro",
        "kind": "text",
        "markdown": "三道家常菜，按人数调整采购量。以下为示例食谱估算，可按口味调整。"
      },
      {
        "id": "controls",
        "kind": "controls",
        "inputIds": [
          "people",
          "main"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "menu",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "本次菜单",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "side",
            "title": "蒜蓉西兰花",
            "description": "清爽配菜",
            "facts": [
              "约 10 分钟",
              "临开饭前炒制"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "cold",
            "title": "拍黄瓜",
            "description": "开胃凉菜",
            "facts": [
              "约 10 分钟",
              "可提前准备"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "rice",
            "title": "米饭",
            "description": "按胃口准备主食",
            "facts": [
              "电饭煲先煮",
              "和主菜同时上桌"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "shopping",
        "kind": "checklist",
        "title": "采购清单",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "chicken",
            "label": "去骨鸡腿肉",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 600,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "chicken"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "peanut",
            "label": "熟花生米",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 100,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "chicken"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "beef",
            "label": "牛腩",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 800,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "beef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "tomato",
            "label": "番茄",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 500,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "beef"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "tofu",
            "label": "豆腐",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 600,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "tofu"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "mushroom",
            "label": "香菇",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 200,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "tofu"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "broccoli",
            "label": "西兰花",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 500,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "cucumber",
            "label": "黄瓜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 500,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "garlic-side",
            "label": "大蒜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 30,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "itemKey": "garlic"
          },
          {
            "id": "garlic-main",
            "label": "大蒜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            },
            "when": {
              "input": "main",
              "equals": "chicken"
            },
            "itemKey": "garlic"
          },
          {
            "id": "ginger",
            "label": "生姜",
            "quantity": {
              "value": 20,
              "unit": "g",
              "scaleBy": "people",
              "base": 4
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "steps",
        "kind": "disclosure",
        "title": "准备顺序",
        "markdown": "1. 先准备凉菜并冷藏。\n2. 洗切西兰花，备好调料。\n3. 烹饪主菜，最后炒配菜。"
      },
      {
        "id": "note",
        "kind": "text",
        "markdown": "选择牛腩时，建议提前约两小时开始准备。复制清单会使用当前人数和主菜。"
      },
      {
        "id": "followup",
        "kind": "actions",
        "items": [
          {
            "id": "vegetarian",
            "kind": "model",
            "label": "改成全素菜单",
            "prompt": "根据这份计划和我的当前选择，重新设计全素菜单。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
